---
// Continuous profiling architecture (Parca / Pyroscope) + Differential pprof (-diff_base & -base).
const W = 900;
const H = 266;
---
<figure class="ge7d">
  <div class="ge7d-scroll">
    <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Continuous profiling scraping Go pods before OOM crashes occur alongside comparing and subtracting profiles with pprof -diff_base and -base.">
      {/* Top flow: Continuous profiling */}
      <rect x="14" y="14" width="872" height="122" rx="10" class="ge7d-card" />
      <text x="30" y="40" class="ge7d-h">
        <tspan data-lang-en>1. Continuous Profiling catches the spike BEFORE the pod OOMs</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>1. Continuous Profiling giữ lại bằng chứng TRƯỚC KHI pod chết OOM</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x="30" y="56" width="220" height="62" rx="6" class="ge7d-box" />
      <text x="44" y="76" class="ge7d-b">Go Pod (:6060/debug/pprof)</text>
      <text x="44" y="94" class="ge7d-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Traffic spike → OOMKill at 02:14</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Tải vọt → OOMKill lúc 02:14 sáng</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="44" y="109" class="ge7d-b-red">Ad-hoc capture is too late!</text>

      <line x1="254" y1="87" x2="294" y2="87" class="ge7d-wire-ok" />
      <polygon points="300,87 292,82 292,92" class="ge7d-head-ok" />

      <rect x="304" y="56" width="256" height="62" rx="6" class="ge7d-box is-ok" />
      <text x="318" y="76" class="ge7d-b-ok">Parca / Pyroscope Agent (15s–60s)</text>
      <text x="318" y="94" class="ge7d-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Scrapes &lt;5% CPU (or eBPF zero-code)</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Hút mẫu định kỳ (&lt;5% CPU) về DB</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="318" y="109" class="ge7d-m">Saves time-series stack history</text>

      <line x1="564" y1="87" x2="604" y2="87" class="ge7d-wire-ok" />
      <polygon points="610,87 602,82 602,92" class="ge7d-head-ok" />

      <rect x="614" y="56" width="256" height="62" rx="6" class="ge7d-box" />
      <text x="628" y="76" class="ge7d-b">02:13 Timeline Playback</text>
      <text x="628" y="94" class="ge7d-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Inspect exact inuse_space right</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Mở lại đúng khung 02:13 trước</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="628" y="109" class="ge7d-b-ok">60s before pod restarted!</text>

      {/* Bottom: Diff & Base comparison */}
      <rect x="14" y="150" width="426" height="102" rx="10" class="ge7d-card is-ok" />
      <text x="30" y="176" class="ge7d-b-ok">go tool pprof -diff_base=v1.pprof v2.pprof</text>
      <text x="30" y="198" class="ge7d-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Computes positive (+) regressions and negative (-) gains per stack.</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Tính thẳng độ chênh (+) nặng lên và (-) nhẹ đi cho từng hàm.</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="30" y="218" class="ge7d-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Ideal before/after PR comparison in Flame Graphs.</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Cực hợp để kiểm chứng bản vá có thực sự giảm CPU/RAM hay không.</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x="458" y="150" width="428" height="102" rx="10" class="ge7d-card" />
      <text x="474" y="176" class="ge7d-b">go tool pprof -base=baseline.pprof with_feature.pprof</text>
      <text x="474" y="198" class="ge7d-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Subtracts shared background noise to isolate Feature A's true impact.</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Trừ bớt phần nền dùng chung để lọc đúng tác động của tính năng A.</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="474" y="218" class="ge7d-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>(Use google/pprof/profile.Merge to aggregate short profiles into one.)</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>(Hoặc gộp nhiều profile ngắn bằng google/pprof/profile.Merge.)</tspan>
      </text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Ad-hoc profiling fails after a crash wipes process RAM. Continuous profilers preserve pre-crash history under a small CPU budget, and pprof -diff_base turns optimization deltas into hard proof.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Chờ sập pod mới bắt pprof thì RAM đã bay mất sạch. Continuous profiling lưu sẵn lịch sử định kỳ rất nhẹ, còn cờ -diff_base giúp chứng minh rạch ròi hàm nào vừa giảm hoặc tăng chi phí sau khi sửa code.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .ge7d { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .ge7d-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .ge7d svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .ge7d text { font-size: 12px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .ge7d-card { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .ge7d-card.is-ok { stroke: rgb(21, 128, 61); }
  :global(html[data-theme='dark']) .ge7d-card.is-ok { stroke: rgb(74, 222, 128); }
  .ge7d-box { fill: var(--bg); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .ge7d-box.is-ok { stroke: rgb(21, 128, 61); }
  :global(html[data-theme='dark']) .ge7d-box.is-ok { stroke: rgb(74, 222, 128); }
  .ge7d-h { font-size: 13.5px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .ge7d-b { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .ge7d-b-red { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--red); }
  .ge7d-b-ok { font-weight: 700; fill: rgb(21, 128, 61); }
  :global(html[data-theme='dark']) .ge7d-b-ok { fill: rgb(74, 222, 128); }
  .ge7d-m { fill: var(--text-muted); font-size: 11px; }
  .ge7d-wire-ok { stroke: rgb(21, 128, 61); stroke-width: 2; }
  .ge7d-head-ok { fill: rgb(21, 128, 61); }
  :global(html[data-theme='dark']) .ge7d-wire-ok { stroke: rgb(74, 222, 128); }
  :global(html[data-theme='dark']) .ge7d-head-ok { fill: rgb(74, 222, 128); }
  .ge7d figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
